silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_02_sections_01_concrete_anchor_3#patientrole77 silm:hasLongDescription "The PatientRole77 is the role Mittens-as-patient-of-this-visit. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'PatientRole77', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
